','[\"1x Frolic Collared Polo Shirt (Orange)\",\"1x Frolic Sports Tee (Sky Blue)\",\"1x Stretchable Denim Pant\",\"1x Cozy Track Bottom\"]',true,3,true,'2026-09-17 03:55:06','2026-09-17 03:55:06'),(NULL,'D.I.E.L. Interactive Home Practice Software Pass','diel-interactive-home-practice-software-pass','digital','Digital Lab','purple','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587654780291-39c9404d746b?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop','₹899','1-Year Parent Access License','Parent-child digital portal with 150+ interactive phonics audio stories, 25,000 oral repetition drills, and real-time pronunciation scoring.','[\"Access on Android, iOS, Windows & Mac\",\"150+ Animated Phonics Video Stories\",\"Speech Recognition Word Practice Drills\",\"Weekly Digital Progress & Analytics Dashboard\"]',true,4,true,'2026-09-17 03:55:06','2026-09-17 03:55:06'),(NULL,'Frolic Hands-On Maths Lab & 17-Rod Abacus Kit','frolic-hands-on-maths-lab-abacus-kit','kits','Cognitive Boost','orange','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509062522246-3755977927d7?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop','₹749','Beginner to Intermediate','Tactile dual-color 17-rod master abacus designed for early arithmetic, paired with mental calculation flashcards and finger-speed exercises.','[\"1x 17-Rod Smooth Glide Physical Abacus\",\"100x Speed Math Flashcards (Addition/Subtraction)\",\"Finger-Dexterity Chart & Visual Bead Guide\",\"Protective Padded Canvas Carry Pouch\"]',true,5,true,'2026-09-17 03:55:06','2026-09-17 03:55:06'),(NULL,'Little Picasso Premium Art & Stationery Caddy','little-picasso-premium-art-stationery-caddy','stationery','Non-Toxic','green','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544717305-2782549b5136?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop','₹599','Child-Safe Certified','Ergonomic triangle jumbo crayons, washable finger paints, child-safe blunt scissors, textured sketch pad, and tactile play dough tubs.','[\"12x Jumbo Triangular Grip Wax Crayons\",\"6x Non-Toxic Washable Finger Paint Tubs\",\"1x Spiral Textured A4 Drawing Sketchbook\